---
/* ============================================================================
   SpotsLine — honest live-availability line under the hero tour CTA
   ============================================================================
   "Spots open in Twos and Threes for fall" — the strongest urgency the site
   can ethically run, because it is simply TRUE (it reads the enrollment
   chair's sheet through /api/availability, the same source as the class-card
   badges). Rendered hidden; src/scripts/availability.ts fills the label and
   reveals it only when at least one class is open or nearly full. Failure,
   empty sheet, all-waitlist: it stays hidden and the hero is complete without
   it. Sits on the navy hero, so the fixed light inks of the proof line apply.
   ============================================================================ */
---

<p data-spots-line hidden class="wcp-proof-line mt-1.5 w-full">
  <span
    data-spots-dot
    class="mr-1.5 inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green align-middle"
    aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-spots-label></span>
</p>

{
  /* Colocated so the hydrator ships on every hero page, not only pages that
     render a ClassCard (Astro dedupes the include across both). */
}
<script>
  import '@/scripts/availability';
</script>
